{"id":"n62121-1-7","stage":5,"title":"상견례 · 见面礼","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62121-1-7-1","ko":"새로 오신 사장님은 어떤 분일까?","zh":"新来的老板会是个怎样的人呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새로","meaning":"重新","explanation":"새로：重新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"2","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"오신","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오신","audio":"/audio/39256306cea9b05b441a.mp3"}},{"text":"사장님은","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理；님：尊称后缀。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사장님은","audio":"/audio/12f45b2dfeba2e715adf.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"분일까?","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분일까","audio":"/audio/ec1f44357070b2cefbc2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"重新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"与以前不同，全新地；或用新的。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]}],"audio":"/audio/ed84bd050d082b6c81eb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62121-1-7-2","ko":"상견례 때 첫 대면을 하면 알게 되겠지.","zh":"在见面会初次见面时应该就能知道了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"상견례","meaning":"见面礼，见面仪式","explanation":"상견례：见面礼，见面仪式","readings":[{"term":"상견례","audio":"/audio/d68a0aa4013a69071dc3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62121","senseId":"1","lemma":"상견례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상견례","audio":"/audio/d68a0aa4013a69071dc3.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"첫","meaning":"首次，初次，第一次","explanation":"첫：首次，初次，第一次","readings":[{"term":"첫","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77610","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"첫","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3"}},{"text":"대면을","meaning":"见面","explanation":"대면：见面；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"대면","audio":"/audio/6004e5e23c729720d6b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57848","senseId":"1","lemma":"대면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dic